allSpellRecords.tooltipWithSymbolicValues:
Hwei paints visions of torment that control enemies.

{{Spell_HweiEQ_Name}}
Hwei launches a terrifying face that causes the first enemy hit to Flee for [1 / 1.125 / 1.25 / 1.375 / 1.5] second(s) and take [70 / 110 / 150 / 190 / 230 + (0.65) × AP] magic damage.

{{Spell_HweiEW_Name}}
Hwei forms an eye that lingers and provides vision locking onto the first enemy champion that enters and launching a homing missile that Roots the first enemy hit for [1.2 / 1.4 / 1.6 / 1.8 / 2] seconds dealing [70 / 110 / 150 / 190 / 230 + (0.65) × AP] magic damage.

{{Spell_HweiEE_Name}}
Hwei paints a set of jaws at a target location that Drags enemies to the center dealing [70 / 110 / 150 / 190 / 230 + (0.65) × AP] magic damage and Slowing enemies caught by [40 / 47.5 / 55 / 62.5 / 70]% decaying over 1.25 seconds.

Hwei paints visions of serenity that provide utility for himself and allied champions.

{{Spell_HweiWQ_Name}}
Hwei launches a current of swift waters in a line that grants allies [(30 / 32.5 / 35 / 37.5 / 40 + (0.03) × AP) × (0.01)] Move Speed.

{{Spell_HweiWW_Name}}
Hwei forms a protective pool that grants [100 / 140 / 180 / 220 / 260 + (0.6) × AP] Shields over time to allied champions inside reduced by @spell.HweiWW:ToolTipAllyMod*100@% for allies.

{{Spell_HweiWE_Name}}
Hwei creates three swirling lights that empower his next three Abilities or Attacks to deal an additional [20 / 30 / 40 / 50 / 60 + (0.15) × AP] magic damage and restore [45 / 50 / 55 / 60 / 65] Mana each.

Hwei paints visions of disaster that deal large damage to enemies.

{{Spell_HweiQQ_Name}}
Hwei launches a blazing fast fireball that explodes on the first enemy hit, dealing [50 / 80 / 110 / 140 / 170 + (0.8) × AP] plus [3 / 4 / 5 / 6 / 7]% max health magic damage.

{{Spell_HweiQW_Name}}
Hwei strikes over far distances with a delayed lightning bolt, dealing [60 / 85 / 110 / 135 / 160 + (0.3) × AP] magic damage. Hitting an Isolated or Immobilized target increases the damage up to [(60 / 85 / 110 / 135 / 160 + (0.3) × AP) × (2 / 2.375 / 2.75 / 3.125 / 3.5)] magic damage, based on the target's missing health.

{{Spell_HweiQE_Name}}
Hwei unleashes a path of eruptions, dealing [20 / 35 / 50 / 65 / 80 + (0.3) × AP] magic damage in an area and leaving behind pools of lava that Slow enemies by @spell.HweiQE:SlowPercent@% and deal [20 / 35 / 50 / 65 / 80 + (0.24) × AP] magic damage per second for @spell.HweiQE:Duration@ seconds.
